{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人李尚正與「妹頭」盧頌恩憑HOY處境劇《你的保安李保安》近期人氣再度急升，而二人主持的王牌旅遊節目《臥底旅行團6.0》將推出新一輯，旅程中迎來極限考驗。</p><p>向來甚少踏足冰天雪地的妹頭，出發前笑言擔心自己會變成「雪條」；</p><p>幸好在機場集合時喜遇妹頭</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:22:54.623501+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T12:01:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T12:18:22.038253+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T12:18:22.038253+00:00","content_hash":"c6dd03d5bec29d7e85f2be080023f851fa835f3c07572efa24a564fcdb12dcb4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}